LeadingLight identity artwork

The page-opening-into-light mark was developed for LeadingLight from a generated
visual concept and rebuilt as a vector master for legibility and deterministic exports.
The source vector and bundled icon exports are distributed under AGPL-3.0-or-later,
the same license as LeadingLight. See the repository LICENSE file.

This mark does not use the Tolaria, Capacities, Notion, or Phosphor logo artwork.
